    "_comment": "Every /host/v1 request carries User-Agent: manar-edge/<version> (<os>; <arch>). build: what the device sends for these inputs; parse: what manar-api stores for a header (null: it stores nothing and keeps the last known value). Old devices send Go-http-client/1.1.",
